Package: koinos-bsp-th1520
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-riscv64, koinos-hwcaps
Recommends: koinos-bsp-th1520-firmware, koinos-bsp-th1520-gpu, koinos-bsp-th1520-vpu
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for T-Head TH1520 (Xuante C910/C906/E902)
 This package provides Board Support Package for T-Head TH1520 SoC
 used in Lichee Pi 4A, BeagleV-Ahead, Milk-V Meles, and other boards.
 .
 Includes:
  * Kernel modules for TH1520 peripherals
  * Device Tree overlays for board variants
  * AON (Always-On) domain firmware
  * Thermal zone configuration
  * PMIC configuration
 .
 Optional sub-packages provide GPU/VPU support (proprietary firmware required).

Package: koinos-bsp-th1520-firmware
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-th1520
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for TH1520 - Firmware blobs
 This package provides firmware blobs for TH1520 peripherals
 including AON, PMU, and thermal management firmware.
 .
 Note: Some firmware may require separate download due to licensing.

Package: koinos-bsp-th1520-gpu
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-th1520
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for TH1520 - GPU support (Imagination GE9920)
 This package provides GPU driver support for Imagination GE9920 GPU
 in TH1520 SoC.
 .
 Note: Requires proprietary Imagination driver firmware.

Package: koinos-bsp-th1520-vpu
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-th1520
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for TH1520 - VPU support (H.264/H.265)
 This package provides VPU firmware and kernel modules for
 H.264/H.265 hardware video decoding/encoding.
 .
 Note: Requires proprietary VPU firmware from RevyOS.
